  "shortDescription": "Tiny Glade is a small diorama builder where you doodle whimsical castles, cozy cottages &amp; romantic ruins. Explore gridless building chemistry as the game adorns your glades with procedural detail. No management, combat or goals: just kick back and turn forgotten meadows into lovable dioramas.",
